<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan's FGEP to tender for 54,000 tonnes of corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan's FGEP to tender for 54,000 tonnes of corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's FGEP corn procurement group will tender on Wednesday for one 54,000-tonne shipment of U.S. corn, traders said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The FGEP group comprises Fwu Sow Grain, Great Wall Enterprises, President Enterprise and Ever Smile Feed Mill Co.</p>
<p>The shipment would be slated for April 10-25 from the U.S. Gulf or April 26 to May 10 from the Pacific Northwest.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>  Shipment    Tonnes    Date/Location</p>
<p>				U.S. Gulf     Pacific N.W.</p>
<p>  One	   54,000    April 10-25   April 26-May 10</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
